:: Campus_Megan
<section><aside id="sidebar"></aside><article><%=window.story.render("CenterDialogs") %>
<% if(s.chars.Megan.state<=0){s.chars.Megan.state=10; %> <!--  start first -->
<p>
You spot $bestfriend.name in the distance talking to a group of people.

Hey there!@@

Oh hi beautiful, didn't see you there. What's up?@@

<div id='select1' >
    <a0 onclick='window.gm.printTalkLink("div#select1","div#choice1a")'>Chat a bit with her before class starts</a>
    </div><div id='choice1a' hidden>
	<img src="img/profiles/rileyprofile.jpg" class="float-left">$bestfriend.name<hr>
