<<link "Chat a bit with her before class starts">><<replace "#megan">><<nobr>><<set _outcome = dice('1d6')>><<if _outcome == 1>><<if $player.sub lt 8>><<set $player.sub +=1>><<set $player.dom +=1>><<set $bestfriend.dom +=1>><<if $appraise is false>><<set _name to "@@.sub;[Submission +1]@@<br>@@.dom;[Dominance: +1]@@">><<else>><<set _name to "@@.sub;[Submission +1]@@<br>@@.dom;[Dominance: +1]@@<br>@@.dom;[$bestfriend.name Dominance: +1]@@">><</if>><<else>><<set _name to "">><</if>><<elseif _outcome == 2>><<set $lust +=10>><<set _name to "@@.lust;[Lust +10]@@">><<elseif _outcome == 3>><<set $lust +=20>><<set _name to "@@.lust;[Lust +20]@@">><<else>><</if>><</nobr>><<if _outcome ==1>>

You won't believe what gem I watched in the tv yesterday! It was one of those artistic, postmodern films. There were these two girls...@@

And then she put on her latex...@@
//That sounds more like smut rather than "artistic"//

Despite what you want though, $bestfriend.name goes into great details while trying to explain the movie to you.
