	You see $bestfriend.name in campus while resting and chat a bit with her.

	You see $bestfriend.name and she asks you what you are doing here.
</p><!--  end first -->
<%}else{ if(s.chars.Megan.state<20){s.chars.Megan.state=20;} %>
<p>
As you scan the surrounding area you spot a perky female rushing towards you.
<img src="img/riley/rileygen1.jpg">
You smile akwardly as you see your best friend since you came to this city, Megan, as she rushes towards you and almost crushes you in a strong hug.
<p class="speech tNPC1"><img src="assets/pics/fnpc.jpg">	Megan<hr>'
Hey there girl! How are you today? I hope you are feeling better. You certainly look like you are feeling better!
</p>

<div class="speech tPC">Lisa<hr>
	Yeah... I'm fine today. It simply was something with my eyes, so I'm hoping that it stays that way...
</div>
$bestfriend.name pauses for a second as she scans you from top to bottom, looking as if she's thinking something before she suddenly yelps surpised.

<div class="speech tNPC1"><img src="assets/pics/fnpc.jpg">Megan<hr>
You got rid of those horrendous glasses! Finally! Now, all we need to do is upgrade the rest of your wardrobe to match and you'll be set!@@
</div>

You said you liked my glasses...@@

$bestfriend.name seems oblivious to your whisper as she continues on...

<div class="speech tNPC1"><img src="assets/pics/fnpc.jpg">Megan<hr>
Although maybe before you splurge on fine clothing, maybe you could join me in the gym for a few sessions first. Remember, you have //promised// me before that you will join me at some point... It's been ages since then.@@
</div>

<div class="speech tPC">Lisa<hr>
I'll try to find some time</span>@@
</div>

You are suddenly jolted by a sudden, stinging, pain in your buttcheek. 

<video src="video/misc/buttslap.mp4" autoplay loop muted></video>

<div class="speech tNPC1"><img src="assets/pics/fnpc.jpg">Megan<hr>
Not that I don't love your cute jiggly ass, but just to stay fresh, you know...@@
</div>

<span style="color: green;">//Interesting. These humans never seaze to amaze me with the number of different greeting gestures. Even smacking someone here is a greating it seems. Or maybe it is only smacking them in their ass? Nevertheless... I guess worth to note that down.//</span>


<div class="speech tPC">Lisa<hr>
Yes...
</div>

<div class="speech tNPC1"><img src="assets/pics/fnpc.jpg">Megan<hr>
Atta girl! Got to run now, see you in Business class!@@
</div>

And as fast as she appeared, she's gone.

sub;[Submission +1]

//Well, at least someone is happy that I'm back alright... now, where were we.//
<%}%>
[[Campus]]
</article><article id="LogPanel"></article></section>

